      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_retry",
      "hash64": "29C355AC84C94806",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hello, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Are you ready\\nto\\r\\npursue\\r\\nquintessential\\r\\nbeauty\\r\\ntogether?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
